    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Based Fantasy RPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character and then go on an adventure by drawing a card from a deck and choosing how to respond to its text. Then draw another and continue exploring the world. Gather items, accept quests, battle monsters, learn spells, level up, and challenge various end-game bosses.<br><br>The cards you draw are always changing according to your location so explore hand-crafted dungeon decks, travel between different map zones to cities and villages to stock up on supplies and find quests, or investigate mysterious ruins where unique game mechanics craft a new card deck dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game editors to build your own decks of exploration cards, items, monsters, quests, and more. Creating new adventures is easy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Based Fantasy RPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character and then go on an adventure by drawing a card from a deck and choosing how to respond to its text. Then draw another and continue exploring the world. Gather items, accept quests, battle monsters, learn spells, level up, and challenge various end-game bosses.<br><br>The cards you draw are always changing according to your location so explore hand-crafted dungeon decks, travel between different map zones to cities and villages to stock up on supplies and find quests, or investigate mysterious ruins where unique game mechanics craft a new card deck dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use in-game editors to build your own decks of exploration cards, items, monsters, quests, and more. Creating new adventures is easy.</p>",
    "short_description": "Create a character, fight monsters, level up, go on quests, and explore dungeons in this card based fantasy RPG. Play by drawing a card, choosing how to respond, and then drawing another. Use our editor tools to create your own cards, monsters, quest lines, dungeons, and more!",
